    },
    {
      "id": "yfp3d1n",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Respiratory Physiology"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "eyg91w6",
      "content": "The respiratory system provides oxygen to the body and removes carbon dioxide."
    },
    {
